{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 55, :comments ["<b>בקרחתו</b> — these are the worn-out ones, for when the garment is worn out the hair falls out and it becomes like a bald spot." "<b>בגבחתו</b> — these are the new ones, for when it is new its hairs protrude. נגע צרעת is written two times: in 'כי תזריע' and in the portion 'זאת תהיה,' for through ten things nega'im come."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:19:22.727816042Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}